{{Quote|And then the TIEs came. Lost another fighter--Red One. I'm ashamed to admit, but I don't know who was flying it, and with everything that happened after, I didn't have a chance to look.|BB-8, recounting the Battle of Starkiller Base|<ref name="Poe Dameron 28">[[Poe Dameron 28|''Poe Dameron'' 28]]</ref>}}
"'''Red One'''" or "'''R-1'''" was a [[human]] [[Gender|male]]<ref name="LEGO" /> who served as a [[Resistance pilot|pilot]] in the [[Resistance]] during its [[Cold War|conflict]] with the [[First Order]]. He fought against the First Order during the [[Battle of Starkiller Base|assault]] on [[Starkiller Base]] as a [[pilot]] of [[Red Squadron (Resistance)|Red Squadron]], a group of [[T-70 X-wing starfighter|X-wing starfighters]]. During the battle, the pilot's [[X-wing starfighter|X-wing]] was shot down by an enemy [[TIE/fo space superiority fighter|TIE fighter]]. The Resistance destroyed the [[superweapon]] shortly after.<ref name="Episode VII" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
R1's X-wing appears in the [[2015]] film [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']]''. ''The subtitles misidentify the character as "Star-1", however this was corrected to "R-1" on the digital version on [[Disney+]].

He appears in a cutscene during the Starkiller battle in ''[[LEGO Star Wars: The Force Awakens]]'' [[Star Wars video games|video game]] as a generic Resistance pilot.<ref name="LEGO" />

